        "descriptionHtml": "<p>AVAILABLE FOR SHIPPING, OR PICKUP IN: Wisconsin year-round, Arizona Jan/Feb</p>\n\n\n\n<p>?Our SAWMASTER 24’’ Large Cutting machine from Rhino Lapidary</p> \n\n<p>is designed for cutting all kinds of materials such as gemstones, marble, ceramics, glass and granite in a fast, safe and standard way in the desired thickness. Thanks to the high technology and durable materials used in our machine, you can cut without any problems for years.</p> \n\n\n\n<p>A key feature in this machine are patented longitudinal, anti-vibration, sealed bearings which provide a wiggle-free vice. This makes your cut less prone to breaking and extensive saw-marks, even at a thickness of 1.5mm.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Cutting speed is 8mm/min (1 inch in 3 minutes). In addition, with the Auto-Feed system patented by Rhino Lapidary, when the saw gets tired or cannot cut for any reason, the vice advancement system automatically slows down and reduces the load of the saw. This extends the life of your saw. It prevents damages such as jamming and breaking caused by user errors. It also protects the motor by slowing down the cutting when necessary and prevents it from heating and burning.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>In addition, the machine has an automatic stop feature for when the cutting is finished or if the cover is opened while it is working.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Fits up to a 24’’ Saw</p>\n\n<p>Blade not included</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Electricity: 110V 60HZ</p>\n\n<p>Cutting Height: 7’’</p>\n\n<p>Cutting Length: 11’’</p>\n\n<p>Cutting Speed: 7/8’’/min</p>\n\n<p>Motor: 1.8KW 1700rpm with crossfeed</p>\n\n<p>Machine Dimensions: 105cm width x 140cm length x 140cm height</p>\n\n<p>Machine Weight: 340lbs</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Blade not included</p>\n\n<p>All parts are CE and TSEK certified</p>",
