        "descriptionHtml": "<p>AVAILABLE FOR SHIPPING, OR PICKUP IN: Wisconsin year-round, Arizona Jan/Feb</p>\n<p>With the new SHAPEMASTER from Rhino Lapidary, it's very easy and quick to make calibrated, exact shapes, even with little to no experience. Shaping a heart, oval, round, barrel, marquise, and many more are all possible just by gently turning the control wheel. You can also make shapes in larger or smaller sizes without changing the master shape.</p>\n<p>29 trendy metal master shapes come included with the machine free.</p>\n<p>The machine uses 6” diameter 1/2\" wheels for 3D shapes and 1/4\" wheels for cabs.</p>\n<p>Electricity: 110V 60Hz</p>\n<p>Motor: 0.55 kW monophase 3000 rpm</p>\n<p>Cooling: circulating tap water</p>\n<p>Wheels: 6” diameter, 1” hole diameter</p>\n<p>1/2 R: 4, 6, 8, 10, 12 mm</p>\n<p>1/4 R: 4, 6, 8, 10, 12 mm</p>\n<p>Dimensions: 20” x 24” x 16”</p>\n<p>Weight: 100 Lb.</p>\n<p>Packed safely in a wooden pallet box</p>",
