        "descriptionHtml": "<p>AVAILABLE FOR SHIPPING, OR PICKUP IN: Wisconsin year-round, Arizona Jan/Feb</p>\n\n\n\n<p>?Sawing slabs and stones for years in comfort is possible with the new TRIMMASTER trim saw!</p>\n\n\n\n<p>You will never have a rusted cutting platform of your machine again, thanks to the Plexiglass surface that easily lifts away. The plexiglass has 4 drainage holes to keep water/oil in the lower reservoir, and adjustable feet let you ensure the tilt is correct for the drainage, even if you are not on a perfectly level surface.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The Trimmaster also comes with spacers for the plexiglass cover that allow you to raise it over the edge of the cutting platform for cutting larger material. There is also a removable, straight-edge guide included for consistent and accurate cutting.</p> \n\n\n\n<p>Electricity: 110V 60Hz</p>\n\n<p>Motor: Monophase, 0.37 kw, &gt;3000 rpm</p>\n\n<p>Cooling: self circulating water/oil</p>\n\n<p>Cutting Length: 5\"</p>\n\n<p>Cutting Height: 2\"</p>\n\n<p>Dimensions: W14” x L22” x H14”</p>\n\n<p>Weight: 50 Lb.</p>\n\n<p>Packed safely in a wooden pallet box</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Blade not included</p>\n\n<p>compatible with 6” or 8” diameter, 1” hole diameter</p>",
